msgstr "epn::estimate-step4.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/epn/modules/ROOT/pages/estimating-gbif-value.adoc:58
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/estimating-gbif-value.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Step 5*: Estimate the hourly wage for a researcher or data scientist in your country. Keep note of this value and the currency in your activity sheet.\n"
msgstr "*步驟 5*：估算您所在國家／地區的研究員或資料科學家的時薪。請將此數值及貨幣單位記錄在您的活動單中。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/epn/modules/ROOT/pages/estimating-gbif-value.adoc:62
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/estimating-gbif-value.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Step 6*: Apply the formula explained in the video to calculate the estimated value of research time saved by GBIF for the year and keep note of the result in your activity sheet.\n"
msgstr "*步驟 6*：運用影片中說明的公式，計算 GBIF 該年度節省的研究時間估計值，並將結果記錄在您的活動單中。\n"

